WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 5.10 · Internal Systems & Operations
Issues, actions and decisions tracking

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Every open issue and action needs an owner, a next step and a date.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Keep one log of issues and actions.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Review it in your weekly or monthly meeting.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Treat repeated issues as risks.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Two late deliveries to an office client: high severity, owned by the salesperson, confirm orders by 3 pm.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create your issue and action routine.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
